sections.body:
Please do not:

- try to break, hack or overload the website;
- use bots or scrapers to copy our products, prices or photos;
- place fake or abusive orders, or use someone else's payment details;
- post unlawful, hateful or misleading content in reviews or messages.

When you write a review, you allow us to show it on the website. We can remove reviews that break these rules.
